m open to it—but I don’t want to see us layering on extras just because they’re available.\n[System]: Decide whether to allocate any additional budget to the proposed LinkedIn retargeting add‑on and the extra intent data topic cluster for this launch, and outline the specific purchasing or non‑purchasing steps you will take now.",
 "response": "I recommend approving both compact add‑ons: LinkedIn’s flight‑limited retargeting bundle (≈$5k fixed fee) and the data provider’s extra topic cluster (≈$1–1.5k), ~ $6.5–7k total incremental spend, kept deliberately small. Rationale: retargeting increases frequency/conversion among the exact 200 pre‑approved accounts who engage or visit (low wasted reach), and the cluster adds a near‑real‑time intent signal to prioritize emerging in‑market accounts into CRM/ad segments for this launch/webinar. Immediate steps: I will confirm the LinkedIn retargeting go‑ahead today so it’s live from day one and instruct the data provider to add the cluster to our feed and push segments into CRM/ads within 24–48 hours. Campaign ops will update audiences/tracking and I’ll ask Finance to issue a PO for the small combined amount—please confirm now if you approve this modest, time‑boxed spend."
