 "resource": "With LinkedIn ABM, multiple data layers, syndication, a sizable LinkedIn top‑up, remarketing, and decision‑intent all in play, most of your moderate discretionary budget for this launch is now committed, though there is still some room before you would risk crossing into over‑spend territory. Internal email, marketing automation, web, and SDR capacity remain available to support additional, high‑touch follow‑up without additional vendor costs.",
