 "antecedent": "You must decide whether to deploy any remaining discretionary budget on LinkedIn’s 7‑day comparison‑focused Sponsored Message burst and/or the data provider’s one‑time competitive displacement insight project, or instead pause new external spend and rely on internal channels plus existing programs to respond to the competitor’s announcement and drive late‑stage conversions.",
