nding, and the impact you expect. I’m comfortable pushing the remaining budget into the highest‑impact options rather than leaving it idle.\n[System]: Decide whether to allocate remaining budget to the LinkedIn comparison‑focused Sponsored Message burst and/or the competitive displacement insight project, or to hold on new external spend and focus on internal follow‑up with your current programs. Outline the concrete purchasing or non‑purchasing steps you will take in response to the competitor’s announcement.",
